Server init.
>> a := Blob nĳ: 4.
a bytes: ( Rige nĳ ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob nĳ: 4.
b bytes: ( Rige nĳ ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a nĳ.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
Utfier skriuwe: ['xorred:'], nije-rigel. 
Utfier skriuwe: n, nije-rigel. 
} fange: { :e Utfier skriuwe: e, nije-rigel. }, begjinne.
a frijjaan.
b frijjaan.
